<title>USA: Saratoga Brands Inc Q1 share down.</title>
<headline>Saratoga Brands Inc Q1 share down.</headline>
<dateline>LAKEWOOD, N.J. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.01		    $0.04</p>
<p> Net		 55,506		   148,708</p>
<p> Revs		2,824,675		4,124,021</p>
<p> Avg Shrs	  10,823,502	     3,813,129</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for the first quarter of 1996 includes a 25,829 charge, or $0.01 per share, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>The company attributed a decline in revenues in part to dicontinuing of unprofitable product lines.</p>
<p>In addition, the company incurred higher first quarter SG&amp;A expenses resulting from management reorganization and cost reduction measures.</p>
</text>
